Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.36,0:02:44.35,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Hello dear my friends
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:46.99,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}夢を語って
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.13,0:02:52.20,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}過ごした日々を覚えてる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:59.53,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}大人になるって　難しんだね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.75,0:03:07.26,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}隠してたもの　探しに行こうよ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:23.48,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}散らかった　心を脱ぎ捨て
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:26.45,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}雲は泳いて
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:30.25,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}顔上げて　飛び出してね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:34.40,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}雨は上がって
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:37.57,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}一緒に歌って
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:40.08,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}手をつないで
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:46.79,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}私は笑って
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:49.96,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}君も笑って
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:53.34,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}きっとこうやって
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:59.30,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}また会いに行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.36,0:02:44.35,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}你好 我亲爱的朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:46.99,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}还记得吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.13,0:02:52.20,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}我们畅谈梦想的那些日子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:59.53,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}要成为大人 可真不容易呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.75,0:03:07.26,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}让我们一起寻找 那些被藏起来的东西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:23.48,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}抛开杂乱的思绪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:26.45,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}云朵游动着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:30.25,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}抬起头 勇敢启程吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:34.40,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}雨停歇了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:37.57,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}一起歌唱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:40.08,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}手牵着手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:46.79,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}我大笑着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:49.96,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}你也放声欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:53.34,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}如此日复一日
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:59.30,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}定会再度重逢吧
